@Ingestion_HostAddress = http://localhost:7071

### Healthy reading
POST {{Ingestion_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteCode": "IN-MUM-0001", "sensorType": "BatteryVoltage", "value": 52.1, "recordedAtUtc": "2026-11-02T09:00:00Z" }

### Critical reading (raises alarm in the log)
POST {{Ingestion_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteCode": "IN-MUM-0001", "sensorType": "ShelterTemperature", "value": 47.5, "recordedAtUtc": "2026-11-02T09:01:00Z" }

### Invalid reading (400)
POST {{Ingestion_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteCode": "", "sensorType": "Unknown", "value": 1 }
